    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 1
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Talulah",
        "text": "Phantom Crossbowmen, I'm glad to see you've returned safely."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Talulah",
        "text": "You brought so many. Are they all our people from Lungmen?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_016",
            "name2": "char_011_talula_1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Phantom Crossbowman",
        "text": "There are so many Infected... who came back with us."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Phantom Crossbowman",
        "text": "I didn't think we'd meet you here."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_016",
            "name2": "char_011_talula_1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Talulah",
        "text": "We can save a lot of lives making full use of Chernobog's resources . This core city will be our final weapon to breach Lungmen."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_016",
            "name2": "char_011_talula_1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Phantom Crossbowman",
        "text": "What? No, my Leader..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Phantom Crossbowman",
        "text": "Why was Lungmen so different from what we planned? So many of our comrades died back there for nothing!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_016",
            "name2": "char_1002_nsabr_1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member",
        "text": "You dare speak to the leader like this...?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_016",
            "name2": "char_011_talula_1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Talulah",
        "text": "No, he's right."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Talulah",
        "text": "Many of our dear friends have suffered so much. The enemy left a lot of treacherous traps for us that disrupted our plans. It was a major setback."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Talulah",
        "text": "However, even if our pioneers faced some obstacles, the Reunion Movement will avenge them. I shall see to it that your wounds, your sacrifices, are made whole again."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Talulah",
        "text": "Worry not. We will be with you, always."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_016",
            "name2": "char_011_talula_1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Phantom Crossbowman",
        "text": "...I hope so, Leader."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_016",
            "name2": "char_011_talula_1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Talulah",
        "text": "Hmm... The person you're carrying... Mephisto? Is he..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Talulah",
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Talulah",
        "text": "Faust sacrificed himself to save him, didn't he?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_016",
            "name2": "char_011_talula_1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Phantom Crossbowman",
        "text": "...That's right, Leader. With no regard for his own life, Faust used his Arts to cover our tracks and give us a chance to escape."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_016",
            "name2": "char_011_talula_1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Talulah",
        "text": "Oh?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Talulah",
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Talulah",
        "text": "Phantom Crossbowmen, my people of Reunion... Faust will live on forever in our hearts."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Talulah",
        "text": "Help him down. Mephisto will need to rest awhile."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Talulah",
        "text": "I will have some men take you to camp."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_016",
            "name2": "char_011_talula_1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Phantom Crossbowman",
        "text": "Another thing, Leader... We lost contact with Crownslayer early on. We haven't heard anything from her. Don't know where she might have ended up."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Phantom Crossbowman",
        "text": "As for... Yeti Squad, and FrostNova, they... they're all..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_011_talula_1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Talulah",
        "text": "\u2014\u2014"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Talulah",
        "text": "Truly unfathomably tragic news."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Talulah",
        "text": "Please, allow me... some time to myself."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
