    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Talulah",
        "text": "Could they be hiding something, or have they been digging around? Their team must know something I don't."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Talulah",
        "text": "Maybe... that battle was somewhat transformative. Those Arts were already exceptional, and he was not talkative."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Talulah",
        "text": "...He cloaked himself in his silence. I thought Faust would be the one to survive."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Talulah",
        "text": "But then, this isn't so strange either."
    },
